<div class="final-note">
  <p style="margin-top:0;"><strong>Note:</strong> Both the tactical semantics analysis and the documentary timeline are reproduced intact. The integration is structural: the letters are read through the same diagnostic framework applied to the 1905 papers, and the uranium timeline is presented as the material trace of the 1939 letter. The gravity precedent (Part I-B) is included as the paradigm case of admissibility failure, showing that the diagnostic framework applies before any test is run and that the method predates Einstein by three centuries. The decoded axioms are the framework's compiler diagnostics applied to the primary sources. Where the historical record cannot settle intent, the text says so; where it can settle structural effect, it does.</p>
